  message: "PR-A LANDED — PR merged to dev ef2544220c. Threaded a concrete class id through the inherited_calls Site meta contract for Site-1 (enclosing_class_id), Site-2 (receiver_type_id, all 3 producers), and Site-3-enclosing (enclosing_class_id). Producer: authoritative method->enclosing-class-id map (clobber-immune) + _receiver_type_id_trustworthy gate (file-unique name AND not import-shadowed). Linker: id-preferred selection validated by 'id in class_symbols AND language==src_lang', skipping the len>1 guard; absent/stale/foreign-lang falls back byte-identically to name+guard. Design + adversarial-review workflows; review NO_GO caught+fixed an import-shadow confidently-wrong-edge regression + 3 vacuous foreign-lang-guard tests (all now verified non-vacuous by disabling the guard). Both packages 100% cov; +146 resolved calls edges on self-analysis. Filed WI-masov (deeper _extract_param_types local-first-over-import root cause). STAYS OPEN: PR-B (Site-3 field-TYPE id via parent-symbol meta['field_type_ids'] + _walk_parents_for_field 2-tuple return) is the remaining piece before WI-supat closes and WI-noham can close."  # 0789
